  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Kids Uncle Milty Travel Vest is designed for young explorers, offering practicality and comfort for outdoor adventures, such as camping, fishing, and hiking. The travel vest features over a dozen pockets, including 13 front pockets and 3 inside pockets, providing ample space to carry all the essentials your child needs on their adventures. The large cargo pocket on the back with a side zipper closure offers additional storage for larger items. Made from a durable and comfortable 55% cotton and 45% polyester blend, this fishing vest ensures long-lasting wear and comfort. Equipped with 3 D-rings (2 under the front pockets and 1 on the back of the neck collar), the kids hunting vest offers versatile attachment points for outdoor gear. The front zipper with a single snap closure and a belt loop add to the outdoor vest&rsquo;s functionality and ease of use.</p>",
